{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/ad6605be65b4740f7bfb7e0c64ca23be.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ribbit Ranch is a cozy idle game where you unwind while you collect and care for frogs. Raise these frogs and sell for them for a profit or keep them around to use in mini-games, breeding and to passively generate money online and offline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/a3b06902420ddd8587a437b8e88bedae.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3a88e1e1a9964bd3901f877556f5c2b9.avif?t=1768991222\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs to get rare frog combinations! Be on the lookout for ultra-rare golden frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3e1ca9c0c907eba80dc20b2d5bbcf575.poster.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3e1ca9c0c907eba80dc20b2d5bbcf575.webm?t=1768991222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/c95d8ca5e5b6c4e58da64610f81072a3.avif?t=1768991222\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your frogs by feeding them, and decide to keep them or sell them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/92217e996a38c7d4c6bbd1a4f95849e0.poster.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/92217e996a38c7d4c6bbd1a4f95849e0.webm?t=1768991222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/d8c1283866d0272a1a9fd6a6d2b831a2.avif?t=1768991222\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hundreds of attributes and millions of combinations of frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/cf6bf54e0a787f1632f6be9cf4654522.poster.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/cf6bf54e0a787f1632f6be9cf4654522.webm?t=1768991222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/917975c048c08cdf0c31620965b6da81.avif?t=1768991222\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed your favourite frogs together to get new frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3fc7df6eea181527b506d9336adbdf92.poster.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3fc7df6eea181527b506d9336adbdf92.webm?t=1768991222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big thank you for supporting my first Steam title! As a solo developer I truly appreciate everyone who has supported the game. Please consider Wishlisting this game if you are even just a little bit interested!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/ad6605be65b4740f7bfb7e0c64ca23be.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Common Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3754430/3dee5683e81ad966cb9dfbb519dcf5c745027bc3.jpg"},{"name":"Uncommon Fan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3754430/e20e73cab10c2723094fc5e98d5e577f34579534.jpg"},{"name":"Rare Admirer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3754430/6ff4eb7d585182a8ace86128246181b9b749b3c5.jpg"},{"name":"Epic Enjoyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3754430/8e30069cf8b82dcc2616ccafdd1f11a9a362de2a.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3754430/09f6fd5b8d8833018331234de01fd1f45b63066d.jpg"},{"name":"Froggy Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3754430/219dfb34ac48e090a3838143de14d8b67fd0e643.jpg"},{"name":"Pattern Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic