ore_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/c3469ecbbaf9925b1523f2d8d62f023d.avif?t=1768991222\" width=580 height=100 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/ad6605be65b4740f7bfb7e0c64ca23be.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ribbit Ranch is a cozy idle game where you unwind while you collect and care for frogs. Raise these frogs and sell for them for a profit or keep them around to use in mini-games, breeding and to passively generate money online and offline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/a3b06902420ddd8587a437b8e88bedae.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3a88e1e1a9964bd3901f877556f5c2b9.avif?t=1768991222\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs to get rare frog combinations! Be on the lookout for ultra-rare golden frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3e1ca9c0c907eba80dc20b2d5bbcf575.poster.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3e1ca9c0c907eba80dc20b2d5bbcf575.webm?t=1768991222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/c95d8ca5e5b6c4e58da64610f81072a3.avif?t=1768991222\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your frogs by feeding them, and decide to keep them or sell them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/92217e996a38c7d4c6bbd1a4f95849e0.poster.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/92217e996a38c7d4c6bbd1a4f95849e0.webm?t=1768991222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/d8c1283866d0272a1a9fd6a6d2b831a2.avif?t=1768991222\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hundreds of attributes and millions of combinations of frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/cf6bf54e0a787f1632f6be9cf4654522.poster.avif?t=1768991222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/cf6bf54e0a787f1632f6be9cf4654522.webm?t=1768991222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/917975c048c08cdf0c31620965b6da81.avif?t=1768991222\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa